NAME
       pwd - print the working directory

SYNOPSIS
       pwd [-L | -P]

DESCRIPTION
       Prints the absolute path of the current working directory.

OPTIONS
       -L, --logical    use PWD from the environment, keeping symbolic
                        links as they were typed (default)
       -P, --physical   resolve every symbolic link
       --help           show a short help text

SEE ALSO
       cd in csh(1), realpath(1)
